<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>come closer</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">sombr</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">I Barely Know Her</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">261jWBGVjAGH4SuOEVLlvO</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.330" end="00:29.436">If you give a dog a bone, he will follow you home and wait for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.436" end="00:31.144">Until he's bored of you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.144" end="00:37.215">If you call my telephone and leave a note at the tone, I won't ignore you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.215" end="00:38.940">Been waiting for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.940" end="00:42.625">Come closer or stay away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.625" end="00:46.498">I can't take loving you halfway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.498" end="00:50.422">I've learned to love the way you taste</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.422" end="00:58.422">The in-between, I cannot take</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.422" end="01:16.256">We're in a dimly lit restaurant on the Lower East Side and you look gorgeous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.256" end="01:17.991">Yeah, I adore you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.991" end="01:24.062">You're the only one I want, and I am one of your pawns, you look around the room</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.062" end="01:25.750">To see who looks at you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.750" end="01:29.424">Come closer or stay away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.424" end="01:33.301">I can't take loving you halfway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.301" end="01:37.229">I've learned to love the way you taste</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.229" end="01:41.172">The in-between, I cannot take</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.172" end="01:49.172">Loving you isn't hard</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.435" end="01:56.484">It's letting go that leaves a scar</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.484" end="02:04.484">Do you feel me too in your heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.037" end="02:12.564">Or only when I touch your parts?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.564" end="02:16.245">Come closer or stay away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.245" end="02:20.160">I can't take loving you halfway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.160" end="02:24.074">I've learned to love the way you taste</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.074" end="02:28.159">The in-between, I cannot take</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.159" end="02:31.852">Come closer or stay away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.852" end="02:35.779">I can't take loving you halfway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.779" end="02:39.674">I've learned to love the way you taste</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.674" end="02:43.770">The in-between, I cannot take</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.770" end="02:47.447">Come closer or stay away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.447" end="02:51.377">I can't take loving you halfway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.377" end="02:55.264">I've learned to love the way you taste</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.264" end="02:59.264">The in-between, I cannot take</p></div></body></tt>